:"There is a big focus on collections teams, rightsizing the teams, putting new systems to manage processes focused on driving timely payments, faster invoicing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2018 Q3","e":"xpo","d":"2018-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bradley Jacobs","x":"There will always be cost out opportunities, because even though we're running the company very, very well, there is always inefficiencies to find, there is always waste that can be removed, there's always process improvement, there's always some places where we're over-staffed, some…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2018 Q3","e":"xpo","d":"2018-11-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Bradley Jacobs","x":"If you look at Q4, even with the revised lower guidance, we're still planning to grow EBITDA over 19%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2018 Q4","e":"xpo","d":"2019-02-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matt Fassler","x":"I want to mention the fourth-quarter restructuring charge we reported.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/15/xpo-logistics-xpo-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2018 Q4","e":"xpo","d":"2019-02-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matt Fassler","x":"This was largely for severance costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/15/xpo-logistics-xpo-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bradley Jacobs","x":"I'm a little disappointed that our price increases on contract renewals were 3.7%, even though 3.7% is nice, it's down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bradley Jacobs","x":"And the only one thing that I'm slightly concerned about is that, that price increases on the renewals are only 3.7%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bradley Jacobs","x":"You're asking about the restructuring charge?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bradley Jacobs","x":"I'll let Matt talk about SG&A. In terms of the restructuring part of your question, you recall, in Q4, we had a restructuring charge of $19 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2019-05-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Bradley Jacobs","x":"As you saw in the release, we reaffirmed our 2019 outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2019-05-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matthew Fassler","x":"Moving on to our full year outlook, we're pleased to reaffirm guidance of adjusted EBITDA of $1.65 billion to $1.725 billion, which represents 6% to 10% growth over 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q2","e":"xpo","d":"2019-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Jeremy Fassler","x":"Price increases on contract renewals accelerated sequentially to 5.2% from 3.7% in the previous quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q2","e":"xpo","d":"2019-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bradley S. Jacobs","x":"Right, I would like to take full credit for that, but I don't think we honestly can, because you can see our competitors are also raising price, and in most cases, raising price more than we are.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q2","e":"xpo","d":"2019-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin Sterling","x":"But Brad maybe what we've seen so far to start the year is that a function of you guys streamlining operations selling off unprofitable terminals?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q3","e":"xpo","d":"2019-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bradley Jacobs","x":"Remember the tariffs started in March 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q3","e":"xpo","d":"2019-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Fassler","x":"Price increases on contract renewals grew by 4%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q3","e":"xpo","d":"2019-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Fassler","x":"Again, our price increases on contract renewals increased 4%, again we think an indicator of consistency in the pricing environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q3","e":"xpo","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bradley Jacobs","x":"The full quarter benefit of the cost-out that we did so well in the third quarter didn't hit the whole third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q3","e":"xpo","d":"2019-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bradley Jacobs","x":"We've got a great management team in LTL that's very focused on efficiencies and productivity and cost-out customer service, but also to the nature of the LTL business which is very different than the truckload business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q4","e":"xpo","d":"2020-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Fassler","x":"We benefited from some restructuring in Q3, which helped us rethink our SG&A org [Phonetic] chart and drove benefits there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2019 Q4","e":"xpo","d":"2020-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Christian Wetherbee","x":"If I can squeeze one more in, just what do you think about the $700 million to $1 billion potential cost savings that you've outlined over the course of the next couple of years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2020 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2020-05-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Matthew Fassler","x":"Our shared distribution model is resonating with brands who want to optimize their direct-to-consumer efforts and shippers looking to augment their e-commerce and omnichannel capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2020 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2020-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Fassler","x":"Price increases on contract renewals remained healthy at 3.7%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2020 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Fassler","x":"We're also looking to take fixed cost out of the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2020 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bradley Jacobs","x":"So getting the right size of the staffing, getting the right blend between full-time and part time, getting the right shift times and shift endings, Smart saved the day on that one.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2020 Q2","e":"xpo","d":"2020-07-31","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Bradley Jacobs","x":"So if consumers are not going to theaters, into sports, and to restaurants, that's not great for the society and for the overall economy, but it's more germane to us what's going on with purchasing of goods.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2020 Q2","e":"xpo","d":"2020-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Fassler","x":"Our LTL price increases on contract renewals remained solid, up 3.7%, which kept us on pace with the Q1 increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2020 Q2","e":"xpo","d":"2020-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Wyshner","x":"This is because of benefits that we expect to realize in Q3 from operating initiatives, restructuring programs and other cost-saving actions that we've implemented.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2020 Q2","e":"xpo","d":"2020-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Wyshner","x":"We also solidified our liquidity, continued to generate significant positive free cash flow, implemented cost-saving actions that will benefit future quarters and invested in technology.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"XPO 2021 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2021-05-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Malcolm Wilson","x":"Right now, order fulfillment times are being compressed, most notably in the [direct-to-consumer e-commerce] (corrected by company after the call) space.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"XPO 2021 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2021-05-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Malcolm Wilson","x":"It will be direct-to-consumer distribution that uses advanced automation [to accelerate deliveries] (corrected by company after the call) and robots to personalize products before we ship them to consumers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"XPO 2021 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2021-05-04","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Matthew Fassler","x":"It's a critical service for emerging e-commerce players, direct-to-consumer players who don't have their own distribution capacity and are seeking to build their connectivity with consumers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"XPO 2021 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2021-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Fassler","x":"Our price increases on contract renewals continue to move in the right direction, both quarter-over-quarter, month-over-month, and into the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"XPO 2021 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2021-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Wyshner","x":"And as revenue increased, we benefited from the operating leverage inherent in our business and the cost reduction actions we took last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"XPO 2021 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2021-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brad Jacobs","x":"And finally, based on the Q1 beat and the strength we're seeing in April, we raised guidance significantly for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/xpo-logistics-inc-xpo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"XPO 2022 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2022-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matt Fassler","x":"Headwinds from this pricing are starting to abate as we cycle big truckload price increases from a year ago and as new linehaul contracts cycle in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/11/xpo-logistics-xpo-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XPO 2022 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2022-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mario Harik","x":"In Q1, our price increases on contract renewals accelerated to 11%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/11/xpo-logistics-xpo-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XPO 2022 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2022-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Wetherbee","x":"When you think about where you are in terms of cost takeout -- so we've gone through some contracting on the truckload linehaul side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/11/xpo-logistics-xpo-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XPO 2022 Q1","e":"xpo","d":"2022-05-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brad Jacobs","x":"So in sum, we produced an excellent quarter and raised our outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/11/xpo-logistics-xpo-q1-2022-earnings-call-tr